+// every other //base randomness consumer -- fully deterministic. Defined here
+// rather than in blink because the generator lives in //base and //base cannot
+// include blink; blink and content reference this constant so there is exactly
+// one definition. See docs/sbxdiff/DETERMINISM.md.
