+            // the real gap between the runs, and about 7.7 hours past the
+            // pinned origin. Every request body built there diverged, and the
+            // page's own realm showed zero divergences the whole time.
+            //
+            // The deferral exists to keep a SANDBOX's bootstrap -- its harness
+            // page and its service worker registration -- off the virtual
+            // clock. A renderer whose main frame is remote hosts no bootstrap,
+            // so there is nothing there to protect and it starts immediately.
