+  // (ApplyVirtualTimePolicy), meaning unlimited advancement; granting a budget
+  // would put a fence back, and once the worker exhausted it the worker would
+  // stop requesting advancement. Because the coordinator advances to the
+  // MINIMUM across clients, that would pin the page's clock too -- the worker
+  // becoming the brake is exactly the failure RULES.md #12 describes. The
+  // page keeps its fence, which still bounds total advancement for everyone.
